<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-3027] TcpDiscoveryImpl.registerLocalNodeAddress() has an infinite loop</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3027</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If &lt;tt&gt;IpFinder.initializeLocalAddresses&lt;/tt&gt; always throws an exception, the join process will hang forever even if there is &lt;tt&gt;joinTimeout&lt;/tt&gt; configured. This can happen, for example, with ZooKeeper finder if provided credentials are incorrect.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We should make sure that &lt;tt&gt;joinTimeout&lt;/tt&gt; is honored in this case as well.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
